Preserve the compositor's current output refresh rate when resizing a headless
output. A zero custom-mode refresh lets wlroots choose its default (60 Hz).
wl_output.mode and set_custom_mode both express refresh in millihertz.

Map a single-screen layout to the sole server display. TigerVNC assigns a new
screen ID when returning to fullscreen after a windowed resize.

